<title>UK: Cetelem sets 1.5 billion French franc 15-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cetelem sets 1.5 billion French franc 15-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CCF and BNP.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CETELEM</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    08.AUG.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.571   PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.371    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 5	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
